    sen0414:methodology "Primary source first: the chapter's named concepts from the textbook ontology built over the published chapter. Then the official documentation for the current release and the PEPs the chapter's topics touch. Every source opened and read on 2026-09-29T08:06:45; every claim taken from text actually read; every behaviour executed under Python 3.14.4." ;
